please=20find=20attached=20the=20quality=20alert=20QA-26-017=20regarding=20=
the=20VEL=20men's=20down=20vest=20(style=20J10911A00305,=20all=20colours).

We=20have=20received=20a=20few=20reports=20from=20boutiques=20about=20the=
=20zipper=20slider=20detaching=20from=20the=20chain=20or=20not=20closing
properly=20after=20some=20days=20of=20wear.=20The=20issue=20is=20linked=20t=
o=20a=20supplier=20batch=20of=20sliders=20and=20concerns=20units=20delivere=
d=20to
stores=20from=201=20September=202026.=20Return=20rate=20on=20the=20affected=
=20units=20is=20currently=20below=203%,=20so=20there=20is=20no=20reason=20to
remove=20the=20style=20from=20the=20floor.

What=20we=20need=20from=20you,=20starting=20today:
1.=20Accept=20the=20return=20or=20exchange=20of=20affected=20VEL=20vests,=
=20also=20without=20receipt=20if=20the=20client=20is=20in=20the=20CRM.
2.=20Use=20return=20reason=20DEF=20in=20the=20POS=20(not=20QUALITY,=20not=
=20CHANGE_MIND).
3.=20Do=20NOT=20repair=20in=20store.=20Put=20the=20piece=20in=20the=20quara=
ntine=20box=20with=20the=20attached=20form=20filled=20in.
4.=20Every=20Friday=20ship=20the=20quarantine=20box=20back=20to=20your=20DC=
=20(CSG=20for=20EMEA,=20TKO=20for=20APAC,=20NJ=20for=20Americas)=20with=20t=
he
=20=20=20return=20label=20"QA-26-017".
5.=20Check=20the=20VEL=20on=20the=20floor:=20if=20the=20slider=20is=20loose=
,=20take=20the=20piece=20off=20sale=20and=20treat=20it=20as=20point=203.

Please=20do=20not=20communicate=20anything=20to=20clients=20beyond=20"we=20=
will=20exchange=20it=20immediately".=20No=20posts,=20no=20comments=20on
social=20media.=20Press=20questions=20go=20to=20Corporate=20Communications.

